 "confirm.en": "<section class=\"update-confirm\" aria-labelledby=\"update-confirm-title\"><h1 class=\"update-confirm__title\" id=\"update-confirm-title\">Install firmware fw-v1.1.0?</h1><p class=\"text-body\">The frame will download and install this version at its next wake, around 08:14. It will keep the update after one successful check-in — otherwise it rolls back automatically.</p><div class=\"update-confirm__actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--secondary\" href=\"/update\">Cancel</a><form method=\"post\" action=\"/update/install\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"version\" value=\"fw-v1.1.0\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"confirm\" value=\"yes\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn--primary\">Install</button></form></div></section>",
